<p class="lh">Revenue growth in Magento and Adobe Commerce is rarely driven by one dramatic feature release. More often, it comes from disciplined optimization across search, merchandising, checkout, performance, and analytics. This infographic expands on that reality by mapping the highest-impact conversion levers and showing how each one contributes to sustainable sales growth. It is built for commerce teams that need practical prioritization rather than generic “conversion hacks.”</p>

<p class="lh">The central message of the visual is that ecommerce optimization is a system, not a sequence of isolated experiments. Improving one part of the buying journey while neglecting others creates diminishing returns. Faster pages cannot compensate for irrelevant search results; strong promotions cannot rescue a checkout flow with trust gaps; robust media campaigns cannot scale if product data quality is poor. High-performing stores treat these elements as connected operating capabilities.</p>

